obs The row booked %612 and renumbered to %617 and then %618 across two rebases -- peers had bound 612 at 20260908.052546 and 617 at 20260908.051419, both ahead of my 20260908.052557. The stamp is the key and every citation of mine already spelled it, so the move cost four lines: the shelf filename, its header, the recital row, and the card's link.
status GREEN -- shared_pen witness GREEN, its control 44 behaviors 0 faults, rishi/tests/file_io.rish GREEN on metal, cold roster 185 guards 183 green 0 red 2 gated. Post-rebase scoped re-verify: 156 green, 2 gated, and one red that reads GREEN run alone -- standing_equipment's live_group_plant leg answers unavailable when the guard runs nested inside a roster pass, which is the environment fact %549 already recorded on this pier.
